    "author": "MURMUR Sound Design",
    "description": "Interstellar spatial pad #005 \u2014 Cosmic Veil. Headphone-first spatial pad \u2014 M3 is algorithmic reverb; load companion QUASAR preset `005-cosmic-veil.quasar` on the master bus for binaural spatial. Hold C3\u2013G4 chords; headphones required. Sweep SPACE and DRIFT \u2014 BLOOM freezes per voice. Engines: Classic, Wavetable, FM/PM, PhaseShape.",
